**The Dog Who Surprised the Moon**

Barnacle wasn't supposed to make news; he was just a golden retriever who liked to lick you three times before making you surprise him with food, and whose left ear had permanently surprised something that shocked his owner, Maya. But today, Barnacle had done more than surprise people. He had decided to surprise the moon.

It started on Tuesday, a day that confused everyone at the Silverpet Café. When Maya walked out of the building, she froze. Her phone was in her hand, but it wasn't playing music;
